
> IMPROV THOUGHTS <


> **GROUNDED SCENES** <

*Robot scenes* - the players are very direct and robotic in stating who they are, where they are, what they are doing, how they feel, and what they want in a scene. It helps learning how important those elements are in setting up the base reality.

*Yes and* - one player says something mundane and the other player says "you said xyz and that's important to me because ijk"

