>** The Game **<

[[beat game]]
Game can be thought of as for every action there is a reaction

Something happened let's see it bigger

Hit hit rest hit

It's important to show and not tell for this

Either add to the character or play into the dualing wants, or add to the world

"Yes and"- ands are gifts


